      "writtenOn": "2019-06-07T16:09:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Both ciphertext_size and plaintext_size should be the same: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/refs/heads/master/third_party/boringssl/include/aes-gcm.h#129\n\nMaybe we could rename to \"cipher_and_plaintext_size\" and put all three on the same line (if they fit) to make it more obvious?",
      "parentUuid": "3d6b0dc0_76417b6d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 103,
        "startChar": 33,
        "endLine": 103,
        "endChar": 51
      },
      "revId": "eec53def0c281f83249a4b91548508ab42b297e1",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
