        "id": 1345639
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-06-07T17:21:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The fact that they are the same length is additional knowledge about GCM128 and we shouldn\u0027t expect the code reader knows that. Then I\u0027ll rename it to \"cipher_and_plaintext_size\".\n\nThey will not fit in one line unless you name it as \"text_size\" or \"len\" but I think that\u0027s not as good as cipher_and_plaintext_size with two lines.",
      "parentUuid": "0e4279c9_bb0adb82",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 103,
        "startChar": 33,
        "endLine": 103,
        "endChar": 51
      },
