        "id": 1158184
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-06-07T16:16:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t have a strong preference either way. AFAIK the rest of the EC code has those in header files and we should try to be consistent. But I\u0027ll defer to EC OWNERS. Aseda, wdyt?",
